<title>FRANCE: Disney denies plans for other Euro park.</title>
<headline>Disney denies plans for other Euro park.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Walt Disney Co said in a statement that it &quot;had no other development project in Europe besides the site of Disneyland Paris.&quot;</p>
<p>The company was reacting to comments by an official of the local government of Valencia, Spain, which said the U.S. leisure giant was among several groups negotiating to build a new theme park on the eastern coast of Spain.</p>
</text>
